{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_028_01_d",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:382f77f4d2dc3b750420f3c6fe0cb6c7066418e521b57c71d0c5ee71efce95ed",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_d:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cbdcb1d6f1fbab7fd5a4f512497359587f4da1ed817a7d40864c410a89ae761a",
      "text": "对甜点的热情……是啊。\n因为我的梦想是“做出世界第一的西式糕点”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_d:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a59ee80fdbf35ff814d42df52aa0a3c58739a1f711f1d9530035e879bf762cf1",
      "text": "像这样一边研究西式糕点，\n一边与你作为偶像共同成长的话，",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_d:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bf707cf5485467f8ed8684ab334be7b4c7339cd1208443022f709ca73d6da750",
      "text": "我就能够掌握让许许多多的人\n绽放笑容的力量了吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f4f400654c57aa77dfedc02e100654fcfdaa7f4506dbd97f2e72ea2a8ea3ab2e",
      "text": "我觉得那股力量，正是实现梦想\n所必不可少的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_d:cmd-000031:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d32660f15b2a205279fa5475d0f88aeee9b04cf26e58f3754bb0b20e84fd84df",
      "text": "毕竟要是称得上世界第一的西点，肯定\n具备让全世界的人都绽放笑容的力量吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_d:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5bc55fa7742d635cf76b987c00b19f27fe278e25bec04fe26dfa3f75ab4680d6",
      "text": "……说起来。在梦想不被父母认可、\n从老家逃出来的时候，我曾深深苦恼过。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_d:cmd-000040:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a5c03b9e03019ab041469a71063a555595991ac4786ef1b12c0b57ea97537b40",
      "text": "是神谷……是Cafe Parade这个容身之处守护了我的梦想。\n如今在315 Pro，我正在进一步接近梦想。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_d:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d45e3aab5f6f52f1d021bd6e1444194bc19743e6d94cfa6717a033a147a68215",
      "text": "我之所以能向前迈进，正是因为有着你\n以及伙伴们这般重大的存在呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_d:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:affb55380fdd6111d80c315133a5c3e182da1780c4c1842e5f08851a8870e6f0",
      "text": "为了庄一郎先生的梦想，今后凡是我能做到的事，\n我都会全力支持的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_d:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c9cf94ca56a5769f146314e08ba240e1133290bf2e0363c7476b7d94f206c47f",
      "text": "然后，等哪天庄一郎先生做出了世界第一的西点，\n请务必也让我尝尝哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_028soi_01_1_2_028_01:1_2_028_01_d:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:04916060ac8885a51d057c9209a66bc2a41b1ab64ade3875d7e04c0d8e70165c",
      "text": "当然可以。\n为了那个未来的某一天，今后我也要加油呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
